<title>USA: G7 talks start in Washington.</title>
<headline>G7 talks start in Washington.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Group of Seven industrialized nations central bank governors and finance ministers started meeting here Saturday, officials said.</p>
<p>The meeting is expected to wind up around 5 p.m. (2100 GMT), they said.</p>
</text>
